{"id":"bab89dfdb11ed6dd","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-negative-translation-pa.md","title":"PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译","display":"thm-negative-translation-pa — PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-negative-translation-pa","aliases":["72-thm-negative-translation-pa"],"display":"thm-negative-translation-pa — PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","[[72-lem-negative-translation-substitution]]","[[72-lem-negative-translation-stability]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V Theorem2.1.1, Corollary2.1.2 and Proof2.1.3, print342/PDF354; local presentation correspondence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source statement and proof outline compared; full derivation not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"使证明状态与实际核对的源证明纲要保持一致"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-negative-translation-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-negative-translation-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-negative-translation-pa — PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51fd0abb8c44dd8e\" href=\"?note=51fd0abb8c44dd8e\" title=\"72-lem-negative-translation-substitution\">72-lem-negative-translation-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dca9eb003d33d86\" href=\"?note=3dca9eb003d33d86\" title=\"72-lem-negative-translation-stability\">72-lem-negative-translation-stability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V Theorem2.1.1, Corollary2.1.2 and Proof2.1.3, print342/PDF354; local presentation correspondence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source statement and proof outline compared; full derivation not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"使证明状态与实际核对的源证明纲要保持一致"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA_0,H_0^\\omega,\\mathcal F_{ar}\">\\(PA_0,H_0^\\omega,\\mathcal F_{ar}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N\">\\(A^N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA_0\">\\(PA_0\\)</span> 是已指定的一阶算术呈现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot\\)</span>；下式中两个可证性关系分别属于原有经典、直觉主义演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PA_0\\vdash A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ H_0^\\omega\\vdash A^N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PA_0\\vdash A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ H_0^\\omega\\vdash A^N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PA_0\\vdash(A\\to A^N)\\land(A^N\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PA_0\\vdash(A\\to A^N)\\land(A^N\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二式按公式归纳用经典De Morgan、量词对偶和双重否定消去。第一式按经典证明归纳：逻辑规则的翻译由负公式稳定性及代入交换验证；排中律的翻译是直觉主义可证的否定式。原书Proof2.1.3的算术步骤是：HA对两个数变量双重归纳证明数相等可判定，故无量词数公理的负翻译由原公理推出；归纳模式的负翻译对应于对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N\">\\(A^N\\)</span> 的归纳实例。当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA_0/H_0^\\omega\">\\(PA_0/H_0^\\omega\\)</span> 使用同一type0等式、后继判别与归纳，适用这些步骤。源证明只有简短纲要；本条记录该接口对应及逻辑主链，未重建完整逐行证明，也不扩大到任意全外延高型经典算术。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-negative-translation-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"51fd0abb8c44dd8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-negative-translation-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-negative-translation-stability","status":"resolved","id":"3dca9eb003d33d86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-negative-translation-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$PA_0,H_0^\\omega,\\mathcal F_{ar}$ 取 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]；$A\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}$，$A^N$ 取 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]。这里的 $PA_0$ 是已指定的一阶算术呈现。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$PA_0,H_0^\\omega,\\mathcal F_{ar}$ 取 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]；$A\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}$，$A^N$ 取 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]。这里的 $PA_0$ 是已指定的一阶算术呈现。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"PA_0,H_0^\\omega,\\mathcal F_{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"A^N","display":false},{"tex":"PA_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"PA_0\\vdash A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ H_0^\\omega\\vdash A^N.","display":true},{"tex":"PA_0\\vdash(A\\to A^N)\\land(A^N\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"A^N","display":false},{"tex":"PA_0/H_0^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2195,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-negative-translation-pa|thm-negative-translation-pa — PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-461","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-negative-translation-pa]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-negative-translation-pa|thm-negative-translation-pa — PA到直觉主义算术的负翻译]]"},{"id":"95251f310e95be8e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：新增中间式由 [[72-thm-negative-translation-pa]] 给出，使经典侧见证提取的依赖链明确分成负翻译与Dialectica两步。负翻译陈述及源证明纲要已核对；本文件原有完整解释定理未逐行验证的限制继续保留。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-505","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-negative-translation-pa]]"}],"outgoing":["b4e2c27ac178897e","0dfc104a5d3297ad","51fd0abb8c44dd8e","3dca9eb003d33d86"]}